<title>USA: TABLE-Medusa Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Medusa Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					  June 30,	   June 30,</p>
<p>				1997	  1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net sales	     $103,185    $85,995   $160,024  $131,068</p>
<p>Depreciation and</p>
<p>  amortization	    6,553	4,651     10,343     7,953</p>
